silm:instances_papers_00_whitepaper_sections_02_mittens_anchor_concrete_anchor#vetrecord_77 silm:hasLongDescription "The VetRecord_77 is VetRecord_77: the electronic health record created at the Tartu Animal Clinic on 2026-05-18 for Mittens's annual exam; the record leg of the twelve-leg cocone. In the paper's apparatus it appears as the symbol 'D_Mittens(record)', a concrete instance grounded in the Mittens domain story; it serves as the anchor whose semantics every diagram, formula, and prose reference back to." .
